{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19303","headline":"和武中丞秋日寄怀简诸僚故 · 刘禹锡","name":"和武中丞秋日寄怀简诸僚故","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"退朝还公府，骑吹息繁阴。\n吏散秋庭寂，乌啼烟树深。\n威生奉白简，道胜外华簪。\n风物清远目，功名怀寸阴。\n云衢念前侣，彩翰写冲襟。\n凉菊照幽径，败荷攒碧浔。\n感时江海思，报国松筠心。\n空愧寿陵步，芳尘何处寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19303.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19303","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}